  "lines": [
    {
      "id": "A01",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "您见过轻轨从居民楼里穿过去的吗？",
      "chars": 16,
      "speech_ms": 3100,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 0,
      "end_ms": 3100,
      "trace_id": "0747c89829132cc4eb7fa624277a4302"
    },
    {
      "id": "A02",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "在重庆李子坝，列车从居民楼中间几层钻进钻出，站就设在楼里，车站和住户各走各的门，互不打扰。",
      "chars": 45,
      "speech_ms": 10960,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 3600,
      "end_ms": 14560,
      "trace_id": "0747c89ba5595e6eaa026620b8793c15"
    },
    {
      "id": "A03",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "很多人以为，这是楼盖好了、轨道硬塞进去的。",
      "chars": 21,
      "speech_ms": 3880,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 14960,
      "end_ms": 18840,
      "trace_id": "0747c89e92884941ff9e11651073dba6"
    },
    {
      "id": "A04",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "其实不是：车站和大楼是同期设计的，轨道从楼里预留的位置通过。",
      "chars": 30,
      "speech_ms": 6980,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 19240,
      "end_ms": 26220,
      "trace_id": "0747c8a0d1cd4eacc6666d482401da46"
    },
    {
      "id": "A05",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "山城的地形逼出了这个办法：地不够平，就往空中要路。",
      "chars": 25,
      "speech_ms": 5270,
      "pause_after_ms": 500,
      "start_ms": 26620,
      "end_ms": 31890,
      "trace_id": "0747c8a3f61b0ddd62380d6b9d9d0fb9"
    },
    {
      "id": "A06",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "这一穿，穿成了重庆的名片，全国的人跑来看。",
      "chars": 21,
      "speech_ms": 4230,
      "pause_after_ms": 400,
      "start_ms": 32390,
      "end_ms": 36620,
      "trace_id": "0747c8a68e34231cbe9625a0f481a05a"
    },
    {
      "id": "A07",
      "role": "爷爷",
      "voice_id": "Chinese (Mandarin)_Male_Announcer",
      "text": "下次去重庆，别光在楼下拍照，坐一趟车亲身穿一回楼，那才叫过瘾。",
      "chars": 31,
      "speech_ms": 6710,
      "pause_after_ms": 600,
      "start_ms": 37020,
      "end_ms": 43730,
      "trace_id": "0747c8a8ff643130a2e9d431cebb1af1"
    }
  ]
}